    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a good start. it sounds like you're saying these orgs are basically just tools for the big players or they're too focused on 'harmony' to be useful. do you think there's actually any realistic way for a mid-sized country to use these institutions to protect its own interests, or is the whole system just fundamentally rigged against sovereignty?",
